config SPRD_FLASH_DRV
	tristate "Spreadtrum camera flash HAL"
	depends on MISC_DEVICE
	help
	  Registration HAL between the ISP camera stack and the per-chip flash
	  drivers. Ported 2026-10-04 from the vendor sources in
	  work/donorcatalog/mods-sprd/sprd/common/camera/flash/flash_drv/.

	  Chip drivers call sprd_flash_register() to publish themselves; the ISP
	  calls sprd_flash_ctrl() / sprd_flash_cfg() / sprd_flash_get_info().
	  Registers a misc device "sprd_flash" and creates its own platform
	  device, so it needs no DT node.

	  Say Y here if unsure -- the driver is harmless unless a flash chip
	  driver registers with it.
